  "d.1c3ocas": "FREE FALL",
  "d.1c7mz24": "Arena kotak 16 km kali 12 km, siling lembut 2.7 km.",
  "d.1c9et86": "Versi 0.5.2 dibekukan: pendirian skuadron, papan tanda ROCKETS INCOMING dan tempat duduk menara senjata.",
  "d.1czllhs": "KRUSER",
  "d.1dlvg7e": "PEJUANG RINGAN",
  "d.1dlyq4f": "420 km di atas bahagian malam, tiga minit sebelum matahari terbit orbit. Ashgrove Station, serpihan pecahan lama, dan lampu Eropah meluncur lalu di bawah.",
